# An image must never carry local secrets or TEST data. Without this file,
# `COPY apps ./apps` baked every app's .env (API, HMAC and client keys) and its
# SQLite orders into the image, and a `docker push` would have published them.
# Credentials reach a container as environment variables, nothing else.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal

# Rebuilt inside the image.
**/_fresh
**/node_modules

.git
**/.DS_Store
